sequenceDiagram
    participant MobileApp as Mobile App (Agent)
    participant Server as NestJS API (/api/v1)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over MobileApp,DB: Call Loop (repeats)
    MobileApp->>Server: GET /calls/next?project_id=X
    Server->>DB: Query next available Client
    DB-->>Server: client + call history
    alt No clients available
        Server-->>MobileApp: 204 No Content
    else Client found
        Server-->>MobileApp: { client, numbers, prev_calls }
    end

    MobileApp->>Server: POST /calls/calling { client_id }
    Server->>DB: UPDATE client.lastDialedAt
    DB-->>Server: ok
    Server-->>MobileApp: { success }

    Note over MobileApp: Agent places out-of-band phone call

    MobileApp->>Server: POST /calls { client_id, status, time, duration?, agent_notes? }
    Server->>DB: INSERT call_detail_record
    alt status == not_interested
        Server->>DB: UPDATE client.status = 'inactive'
    end
    DB-->>Server: ok
    Server-->>MobileApp: { id, status }
